flowchart LR
    UP[Uploaded File]
    TYPE{File Type}
    TXT[Read text / Markdown]
    PDF[Extract PDF text]
    OCR[Render low-text page / OCR]
    CHUNK[800-character chunk / 120 overlap]
    EMBED[Create bge-m3 embeddings]
    D2[(ChromaDB docs)]
    Q[Question]
    EV[Embed question]
    QUERY[Top-K cosine query]
    SRC[Top 4 source chunks]

    UP --> TYPE
    TYPE --> TXT
    TYPE --> PDF
    PDF --> OCR
    TXT --> CHUNK
    PDF --> CHUNK
    OCR --> CHUNK
    CHUNK --> EMBED --> D2
    Q --> EV --> QUERY
    QUERY --> D2
    D2 --> SRC
